notes:        Original work for this repository: the Jilo Studio icon's aperture (assets/brand/jilo/jilo-studio.svg: its gaps and opening in the panel colour) as a cover on a dark panel, an editing-track arrow, no text. Written by packaging/macos/icon/bg.py. Layout and rules from the FilmCraft DMG background by @XusBadia. packaging/macos/dmg/generate.py renders it to background.tiff. See packaging/macos/dmg/README.md.
